<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Meridian Capital — Daily Dashboard</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --navy: #0F1C33;
    --gold: #D4AF6A;
    --parchment: #E8E3D3;
    --gain: #7FBF7F;
    --loss: #C97A7A;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--navy);
    color: var(--parchment);
    font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
    padding: 32px 24px 64px;
  }
  h1, h2, .wordmark {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
  }
  .wrap { max-width: 920px; margin: 0 auto; }

  header.masthead {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 18px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gold);
    padding-bottom: 18px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }
  header.masthead .titles { flex: 1; }
  .wordmark {
    font-size: 28px;
    letter-spacing: 4px;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--parchment);
  }
  .tagline { margin: 4px 0 0; color: var(--gold); font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 1px; }
  .generated { margin: 2px 0 0; font-size: 12px; color: #9aa5bd; }

  section { margin-bottom: 34px; }
  h2 {
    font-size: 15px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gold);
    border-bottom: 1px solid #2A3B5C;
    padding-bottom: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .metrics-row { display: flex; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .metric {
    flex: 1 1 180px;
    background: #142544;
    border: 1px solid #2A3B5C;
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
  }
  .metric .label { font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 1px; color: var(--gold); text-transform: uppercase; }
  .metric .value { font-size: 22px; margin-top: 6px; }

  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px; }
  th, td { text-align: left; padding: 7px 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #24365a; }
  th { color: var(--gold); font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: 0.5px; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; }
  tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
  .num { text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .pos { color: var(--gain); }
  .neg { color: var(--loss); }
  .pill {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 1px 8px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    font-size: 11px;
  }
  .pill.blocked { background: rgba(201,122,122,0.25); color: var(--loss); }
  .pill.trending { background: rgba(127,191,127,0.2); color: var(--gain); }
  .pill.choppy { background: rgba(212,175,106,0.2); color: var(--gold); }
  .pill.undecided { background: rgba(154,165,189,0.2); color: #9aa5bd; }
  .pill.live { background: rgba(127,191,127,0.2); color: var(--gain); }
  .pill.benched { background: rgba(154,165,189,0.2); color: #9aa5bd; }

  .note { font-size: 12px; color: #9aa5bd; margin-top: 8px; }
  .warning {
    border-left: 3px solid var(--gold);
    background: #142544;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--gold);
  }
  .empty { color: #9aa5bd; font-style: italic; font-size: 13px; }
  header.masthead svg { width: 60px; height: 60px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  svg { width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid #2A3B5C; }
  .chart-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 18px; }
  footer { text-align: center; font-size: 11px; color: #5f6c8a; margin-top: 40px; }

  .tabs {
    display: flex;
    gap: 4px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #2A3B5C;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }
  .tab-btn {
    appearance: none;
    background: none;
    border: none;
    border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;
    color: #9aa5bd;
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 14px;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 10px 4px 12px;
    margin-right: 22px;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .tab-btn:hover { color: var(--parchment); }
  .tab-btn.active { color: var(--gold); border-bottom-color: var(--gold); }
  .tab-panel { display: none; }
  .tab-panel.active { display: block; }

  .roster {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(196px, 1fr));
    gap: 18px;
  }
  .roster .member {
    background: #142544;
    border: 1px solid #2A3B5C;
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 16px 16px 18px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .roster .portrait {
    width: 96px;
    height: 96px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center top;
    border: 1px solid var(--gold);
    background: #0F1C33;
    display: block;
    margin: 0 auto 12px;
  }
  .roster .member-name {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 17px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .roster .member-role {
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gold);
    margin: 5px 0 9px;
  }
  .roster .member-desc {
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: #9aa5bd;
    margin: 0;
    text-align: left;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">

  <header class="masthead">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 60 60" width="60" height="60" aria-label="Meridian Capital compass rose">
      <circle cx="30" cy="30" r="26" fill="none" stroke="#D4AF6A" stroke-width="1.5"/>
      <circle cx="30" cy="30" r="18" fill="none" stroke="#D4AF6A" stroke-width="1"/>
      <line x1="30" y1="6"  x2="30" y2="54" stroke="#D4AF6A" stroke-width="0.75"/>
      <line x1="6"  y1="30" x2="54" y2="30" stroke="#D4AF6A" stroke-width="0.75"/>
      <line x1="48.38" y1="11.62" x2="51.21" y2="8.79"  stroke="#D4AF6A" stroke-width="1"/>
      <line x1="48.38" y1="48.38" x2="51.21" y2="51.21" stroke="#D4AF6A" stroke-width="1"/>
      <line x1="11.62" y1="48.38" x2="8.79"  y2="51.21" stroke="#D4AF6A" stroke-width="1"/>
      <line x1="11.62" y1="11.62" x2="8.79"  y2="8.79"  stroke="#D4AF6A" stroke-width="1"/>
      <line x1="30" y1="4"  x2="30" y2="0"  stroke="#D4AF6A" stroke-width="1"/>
      <line x1="30" y1="56" x2="30" y2="60" stroke="#D4AF6A" stroke-width="1"/>
      <line x1="56" y1="30" x2="60" y2="30" stroke="#D4AF6A" stroke-width="1"/>
      <line x1="4"  y1="30" x2="0"  y2="30" stroke="#D4AF6A" stroke-width="1"/>
      <polygon points="30,10 27,30 33,30" fill="#D4AF6A"/>
      <polygon points="30,50 27,30 33,30" fill="none" stroke="#D4AF6A" stroke-width="1"/>
      <circle cx="30" cy="30" r="2" fill="#D4AF6A"/>
    </svg>
    <div class="titles">
      <p class="wordmark">MERIDIAN CAPITAL</p>
      <p class="tagline">multi-agent trading research desk</p>
      <p class="generated">{{ generated_at }}</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <nav class="tabs">
    <button type="button" class="tab-btn active" data-tab="dashboard">Dashboard</button>
    <button type="button" class="tab-btn" data-tab="floor">The Floor</button>
  </nav>

  <div id="tab-dashboard" class="tab-panel active">

    <section>
    <h2>Key Metrics</h2>
    <div class="metrics-row">
      {% if ledger %}
      <div class="metric">
        <div class="label">Paper Portfolio Value</div>
        <div class="value">${{ "{:,.0f}".format(ledger.equity) }}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="metric">
        <div class="label">P&amp;L Since Inception</div>
        <div class="value {{ 'pos' if ledger.total_pnl >= 0 else 'neg' }}">
          {{ "%+.1f"|format(ledger.total_pnl_pct) }}%
        </div>
      </div>
      {% else %}
      <div class="metric">
        <div class="label">Starting Paper Capital</div>
        <div class="value">${{ "{:,.0f}".format(starting_capital) }}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="metric">
        <div class="label">Live Traders</div>
        <div class="value">{{ live_traders|length }} / {{ (live_traders|length) + (benched_traders|length) }}</div>
      </div>
      {% endif %}
      <div class="metric">
        <div class="label">vs. SPY Buy-and-Hold</div>
        {% set spy = benchmark_rows|selectattr("symbol", "equalto", "SPY")|list %}
        <div class="value {{ 'pos' if spy and spy[0].cagr >= 0 else 'neg' }}">
          {{ "%.2f"|format(spy[0].cagr) if spy else "n/a" }}%
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    {% if ledger %}
    <p class="note">Live paper P&amp;L from the persisted ledger
      ({{ ledger.trade_count }} trade(s) since inception).
      {% if ledger.halted %}⛔ HALTED: {{ ledger.halt_reason }} — clear with
      <code>python main.py clear-halt</code> before this account trades again.{% endif %}</p>
    {% else %}
    <p class="note">No live P&amp;L yet — paper trading begins with <code>python main.py paper</code>.
      Metrics above describe today's research run, not a funded account.</p>
    {% endif %}
  </section>

  {% if synthetic_symbols %}
  <section>
    <div class="warning">⚠ {{ synthetic_symbols|join(', ') }} used synthetic data today. Every
      number touching {{ synthetic_symbols|join(', ') }} describes a random walk, not a market —
      do not act on it.</div>
  </section>
  {% endif %}

  {% if recommendation_rows %}
  <section>
    <h2>Lifecycle — Important Inquiry (Charles + George)</h2>
    <table>
      <tr><th>Trader</th><th>Trigger</th><th>Recommendation</th><th>Detail</th></tr>
      {% for row in recommendation_rows %}
      <tr>
        <td>{{ row.trader }}</td>
        <td>{{ row.trigger.replace('_', ' ') }}</td>
        <td><span class="pill blocked">{{ row.action }}</span></td>
        <td>{{ row.detail }}</td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </table>
    <p class="note">Recommendation only — nothing is benched without the operator's explicit
      approval (<code>python main.py bench --trader X --trigger ...</code>).</p>
  </section>
  {% endif %}

  {% if ledger %}
  <section>
    <h2>Paper Ledger (Cornelius)</h2>
    {% if ledger.positions %}
    <table>
      <tr><th>Ticker</th><th class="num">Shares</th><th class="num">Entry</th>
          <th class="num">Price</th><th class="num">Days Held</th>
          <th class="num">Market Value</th><th class="num">Unrealized P&amp;L</th></tr>
      {% for row in ledger.positions %}
      <tr>
        <td>{{ row.symbol }}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ row.shares }}</td>
        <td class="num">${{ row.entry_price }}</td>
        <td class="num">${{ row.price }}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ row.days_held }}</td>
        <td class="num">${{ "{:,.0f}".format(row.market_value) }}</td>
        <td class="num {{ 'pos' if row.unrealized_pnl >= 0 else 'neg' }}">
          {{ "{:+,.0f}".format(row.unrealized_pnl) }}
        </td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </table>
    {% else %}
    <p class="empty">No open positions. Cash: ${{ "{:,.0f}".format(ledger.cash) }}</p>
    {% endif %}
  </section>
  {% endif %}

  <section>
    <h2>Target Allocation (post-regime)</h2>
    {% if target_rows %}
    <table>
      <tr><th>Ticker</th><th class="num">Target %</th><th class="num">Target $</th><th>Contributors</th><th></th></tr>
      {% for row in target_rows %}
      <tr>
        <td>{{ row.symbol }}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ "%.1f"|format(row.target_pct) }}%</td>
        <td class="num">${{ "{:,.0f}".format(row.target_dollars) }}</td>
        <td>{{ row.contributors }}</td>
        <td>{% if row.capped %}<span class="pill blocked">capped</span>{% endif %}</td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </table>
    {% else %}
    <p class="empty">No traders live today — no target positions. This is deliberate: no
      delivery is worse than a delivery of "nothing today."</p>
    {% endif %}
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Charts</h2>
    <div class="chart-grid">
      {{ equity_chart }}
      {{ drawdown_chart }}
      {{ trader_bar_chart }}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Data (Wong)</h2>
    <table>
      <tr><th>Symbol</th><th class="num">Bars</th><th>Source</th><th>Last</th><th></th></tr>
      {% for row in data_rows %}
      <tr>
        <td>{{ row.symbol }}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ row.bars }}</td>
        <td>{{ row.source }}</td>
        <td>{{ row.last_date }}</td>
        <td>{% if row.synthetic %}<span class="pill blocked">synthetic</span>{% endif %}</td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </table>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Compliance (David)</h2>
    {% if compliance_rows %}
    <table>
      <tr><th>Symbol</th><th>Reason</th></tr>
      {% for row in compliance_rows %}
      <tr><td>{{ row.symbol }}</td><td>{{ row.reason }}</td></tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </table>
    {% else %}
    <p class="empty">No blocks.</p>
    {% endif %}
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Regime (Greg)</h2>
    <table>
      <tr><th>Symbol</th><th>Regime</th><th class="num">ADX</th><th>Detail</th></tr>
      {% for row in regime_rows %}
      <tr>
        <td>{{ row.symbol }}</td>
        <td><span class="pill {{ row.regime }}">{{ row.regime }}</span></td>
        <td class="num">{{ row.adx }}</td>
        <td>{{ row.detail }}</td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </table>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Walk-Forward Validation (Charles)</h2>
    <table>
      <tr><th>Strategy</th><th>Symbol</th><th class="num">Folds</th><th class="num">Sharpe</th>
          <th class="num">Max DD</th><th></th><th>Reason</th></tr>
      {% for row in validation_rows %}
      <tr>
        <td>{{ row.strategy }}</td>
        <td>{{ row.symbol }}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ row.folds_passed }}/{{ row.folds_total }}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ row.sharpe }}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ row.max_drawdown }}%</td>
        <td>{% if row.eligible %}<span class="pill live">pass</span>{% else %}<span class="pill blocked">fail</span>{% endif %}</td>
        <td>{{ row.reject_reason }}</td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </table>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Risk &amp; Allocation (Charles + Greg)</h2>
    <p><strong>Live:</strong>
      {% if live_traders %}
        {% for t in live_traders %}<span class="pill live">{{ t }}</span> {% endfor %}
      {% else %}
        <span class="empty">none today</span>
      {% endif %}
    </p>
    {% if benched_traders %}
    <p><strong>Benched:</strong></p>
    <table>
      <tr><th>Trader</th><th>Reason</th></tr>
      {% for trader, reason in benched_traders %}
      <tr><td><span class="pill benched">{{ trader }}</span></td><td>{{ reason }}</td></tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </table>
    {% endif %}
    {% if allocation_rows %}
    <p style="margin-top:16px;"><strong>Regime-adjusted weights:</strong></p>
    <table>
      <tr><th>Strategy</th><th>Symbol</th><th>Regime</th><th></th>
          <th class="num">Base %</th><th class="num">Adjusted %</th><th>Note</th></tr>
      {% for row in allocation_rows %}
      <tr>
        <td>{{ row.strategy }}</td>
        <td>{{ row.symbol }}</td>
        <td><span class="pill {{ row.regime }}">{{ row.regime }}</span></td>
        <td>{% if row.matched %}<span class="pill live">matched</span>{% else %}<span class="pill benched">mismatched</span>{% endif %}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ row.base_weight }}%</td>
        <td class="num">{{ row.adjusted_weight }}%</td>
        <td>{{ row.note }}</td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </table>
    {% endif %}
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Buy-and-Hold Benchmark</h2>
    <table>
      <tr><th>Symbol</th><th class="num">Sharpe</th><th class="num">CAGR</th><th class="num">Max DD</th></tr>
      {% for row in benchmark_rows %}
      <tr>
        <td>{{ row.symbol }}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ row.sharpe }}</td>
        <td class="num {{ 'pos' if row.cagr >= 0 else 'neg' }}">{{ row.cagr }}%</td>
        <td class="num">{{ row.max_drawdown }}%</td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </table>
  </section>

  </div>

  <div id="tab-floor" class="tab-panel">

    <section>
    <h2>The Floor</h2>
    <div class="roster">
      <div class="member">
        <img class="portrait" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Wong, Data Agent">
        <p class="member-name">Wong</p>
        <p class="member-role">Data Agent</p>
        <p class="member-desc">Sources daily OHLCV history across the universe: yfinance for equities, ccxt against Binance for crypto. When a feed fails, falls back to a seeded random walk so the pipeline never breaks, and marks the result synthetic so no downstream stage mistakes it for a real result.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="member">
        <img class="portrait" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="David, Compliance Agent">
        <p class="member-name">David</p>
        <p class="member-role">Compliance Agent</p>
        <p class="member-desc">Runs data quality checks before any strategy touches the tape: multi-day gaps, zero or negative prices, stale feeds, and implausible day-over-day moves that suggest an unadjusted corporate action. Holds standing authority to block a ticker for the day.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="member">
        <img class="portrait" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Leo, Backtest Agent">
        <p class="member-name">Leo</p>
        <p class="member-role">Backtest Agent</p>
        <p class="member-desc">Runs every strategy and ticker combination through the vectorized engine with full cost modeling — commission and slippage charged on position change, so a round trip pays both ways. Produces the raw in-sample results the rest of the desk works from.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="member">
        <img class="portrait" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Greg, Regime Agent">
        <p class="member-name">Greg</p>
        <p class="member-role">Regime Agent</p>
        <p class="member-desc">Classifies each ticker independently as trending, choppy, or undecided using ADX, moving-average slope, and realized volatility percentile. Halves allocation and requires multi-day confirmation for traders working against their regime — tilts the book, never benches outright.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="member">
        <img class="portrait" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Charles, Risk Agent">
        <p class="member-name">Charles</p>
        <p class="member-role">Risk Agent</p>
        <p class="member-desc">Walk-forward validates every candidate across five folds, hard-rejects anything breaching the drawdown limit, and caps the live roster. Sizes survivors by inverse-volatility risk parity, with correlated mean-reversion traders sharing a single slot so true exposure isn't silently doubled.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="member">
        <img class="portrait" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Edwin, Sentiment Agent">
        <p class="member-name">Edwin</p>
        <p class="member-role">Sentiment Agent</p>
        <p class="member-desc">Surfaces news sentiment flags across the universe via Alpha Vantage. Strictly informational: never sizes a position, never vetoes a strategy, never touches capital.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="member">
        <img class="portrait" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Cornelius, Execution Agent">
        <p class="member-name">Cornelius</p>
        <p class="member-role">Execution Agent</p>
        <p class="member-desc">Implements the executor across research, paper, and live modes. Simulates fills against the persisted ledger, marks positions to market, and enforces the halt conditions that stop trading before the account does.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="member">
        <img class="portrait" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="George, Reporting Agent">
        <p class="member-name">George</p>
        <p class="member-role">Reporting Agent</p>
        <p class="member-desc">Assembles this dashboard from every stage of the pipeline and delivers the daily standup to Slack. Flags synthetic data and empty-roster days explicitly rather than reporting nothing.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  </div>


  <footer>
    Not financial advice. Backtests overfit. Markets change. — Meridian Capital v1.0
  </footer>
</div>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll('.tab-btn').forEach(function (btn) {
    btn.addEventListener('click', function () {
      document.querySelectorAll('.tab-btn').forEach(function (b) { b.classList.remove('active'); });
      document.querySelectorAll('.tab-panel').forEach(function (p) { p.classList.remove('active'); });
      btn.classList.add('active');
      document.getElementById('tab-' + btn.dataset.tab).classList.add('active');
    });
  });
</script>
</body>
</html>
